  <name>Pre-Plan Endurance</name>
  <description>PRE-PLAN WEEK: Endurance Ride
Edward - 2 days until plan starts

WORKOUT:
- 75-90 min at Z2 (60-70% FTP)
- Practice fueling: use the personalized target in your guide
- Stay hydrated

OUTDOOR STRONGLY ENCOURAGED:
- Build confidence on gravel/mixed terrain
- Practice reading the road ahead
- Test your nutrition strategy

Almost there, Edward!</description>
